the operational model.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "READ PATH (data in)\nplatform tables -> YAML mapping -> Postgres (bitemporal, RLS)\n-> semantic graph. Platform stays the system of record\nfor raw data; Amarh holds the operational model.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e82", "type": "rectangle", "x": 690, "y": 1500, "width": 600, "height": 120, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 397624, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 836406, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e83", "type": "text", "x": 698, "y": 1522.5, "width": 584, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 25483, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7061, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WRITE PATH (decisions out)\napproved action -> one transaction -> audit -> outbox\n-> webhook / API call back to source system or platform.\nNo agent writes straight to the platform.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WRITE PATH (decisions out)\napproved action -> one transaction -> audit -> outbox\n-> webhook / API call back to source system or platform.\nNo agent writes straight to the platform.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e84", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1650, "width": 400, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 982202, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 439385, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e85", "type": "text", "x": 68, "y": 1677.5, "width": 384, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 559742, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 42867, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "IDENTITY\nplatform SSO groups map to Amarh roles,\nreplacing today's x-role header.\nSame permissions, real login.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "IDENTITY\nplatform SSO groups map to Amarh roles,\nreplacing today's x-role header.\nSame permissions, real login.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e86", "type": "rectangle", "x": 490, "y": 1650, "width": 400, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 667580, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 338320, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e87", "type": "text", "x": 498, "y": 1677.5, "width": 384, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 259865, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 271423, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GOVERNANCE\nplatform lineage + classification feed\nmasking and row rules; Amarh adds\nper-edge filtering and audit.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "GOVERNANCE\nplatform lineage + classification feed\nmasking and row rules; Amarh adds\nper-edge filtering and audit.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e88", "type": "rectangle", "x": 920, "y": 1650, "width": 370, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#96f2d7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 977092, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 863385, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e89", "type": "text", "x": 928, "y": 1677.5, "width": 354, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 885178, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 593170, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "VALUE\nplatform answers 'what is the data';\nAmarh answers 'what does it mean,\nwhat should we do, who approved'.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "VALUE\nplatform answers 'what is the data';\nAmarh answers 'what does it mean,\nwhat should we do, who approved'.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e90", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1810, "width": 1230, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 319044, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 295702, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e91", "type": "text", "x": 68, "y": 1856.25, "width": 1214, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 139376, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 369456, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HONEST STATUS: Amarh today runs on simulated data in Postgres. A connector to a real data platform, SSO, and a live Claude run are NOT built yet.\nThey are the next integration steps; the ontology, permissions, action and audit design already assume them.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HONEST STATUS: Amarh today runs on simulated data in Postgres. A connector to a real data platform, SSO, and a live Claude run are NOT built yet.\nThey are the next integration steps; the ontology, permissions, action and audit design already assume them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "baseline": 15}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}